        "When harvested, earn %{a}\u0000Player is offered a new crop-type that yields resources. eg: PERMANENT CROP: 'When harvested, earn +5 gold'": "\u6536\u5272\u6642\u7372\u5f97 %{a}",
        "When harvested, spawns 3 grass crops": "\u6536\u5272\u6642\uff0c\u751f\u6210 3 \u500b\u8349\u985e\u4f5c\u7269",
