        "XP Gain Multiplier\u0000A stats": "\u7d93\u9a57\u503c\u52a0\u6210\u500d\u7387",
        "You have %{chestCount} chest(s)\u0000Used to show how many cosmetic chest user has": "\u4f60\u6709 %{chestCount} \u500b\u5bf6\u7bb1",
        "You've entered a code.\u0000Error message when user already entered a friend code. Each user can only enter one code for their account.": "\u4f60\u5df2\u8f38\u5165\u904e\u4ee3\u78bc\u3002",
        "Your storage is full!\u0000For example, the player can only store 1000 gold, or 500 logs maximum, and they have reached that limit": "\u5132\u5b58\u7a7a\u9593\u5df2\u6eff\uff01",
        "for every %{1} crops harvested, spawn residue {residue}.": "\u6bcf\u63a1\u6536 %{1} \u500b\u4f5c\u7269\uff0c\u5373\u7522\u751f\u6b98\u6e23 {residue}\u3002",
        "x%{amount:.14g} Resource Multiplier": "x%{amount:.14g} \u8cc7\u6e90\u500d\u7387",
